# Copy to a consumer repo's .npmrc to install @arvex-dev/* from GitHub Packages (the kit is private).
# The token (read:packages) never goes in this file: pnpm 11 ignores credentials from a project .npmrc.
# Once per machine (user-level config):
#   gh auth refresh -h github.com -s read:packages
#   pnpm config set "//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken" "$(gh auth token)"
# On a CI runner, write the same line to the runner's ~/.npmrc from a secret.
@arvex-dev:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
